//  THE LAYER CONTRACT (2026-09-27; the full table is lab/SOUND_MAPPING.md):
//    TIME → the GROUND (continuous). /dark_frame carries the region's state on the date shown,
//      each driver stretched over the dates on screen ("relative within the period", Miguel D3):
//        temperature → pitch      \undercurrent body + \midcurrent1 carrier      [reanalysis field]
//        salinity    → space      echo/tail on the rain + chimes (\transProc)    [reanalysis field]
