//        anomaly     → tremolo    the whole drone (\droneProc)                   [reanalysis field, vs each
//                                                                                 place's record average, D1]
//        water mass  → bed + bell \midcurrent2 pad; a CLEAN bell on a change,    [physical classification]
//                                 pitched by the arriving mass (D7)
