//    LEGEND → /dark_legend hold|release: THE DATE SHOWN WITH ONE DRIVER PUSHED, cooked by the SAME
//             ~frameCook as playback (manual C5 §19); only that driver's layer sounds (~legendLayers);
//             release returns exactly to the date shown
//    SOUND TAB → /dark_mix (seven layer faders) · /dark_master vol|mute
//  Legacy: /dark_sonification (the .darkproj brain, dev only) still reaches ~applyOcean with its
//  OLDER contract (KMeans pitches, no salinity or anomaly); the display never sends it.
